  "content_type": "概念解释",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "summary": "作者以天梁意外特质解释命或夫妻会桃花的婚姻风险，并论天同巳亥命：多吉无煞可表感情丰富，无吉多煞则可能不利，但祿存同坐、会魁钺或空劫为明确例外，须实际组合。均为来源命理判断，不据此指认现实出轨。",
  "summary_en": "The author links Tian Liang’s accident symbolism with relationship risks when Life or Spouse meets peach-blossom stars. For Si–Hai Tian Tong Life, many benefics without malefics may signify emotional richness, whereas lack of benefics and many malefics may be unfavorable. Lu Cun sharing Life, or meetings with Kui Yue or Kong Jie, are explicit exceptions requiring actual combinations. These are attributed astrological claims, not evidence of real infidelity.",
